title: JF's nix rec's
pid: 7a777a00-82ff-4d3c-ac06-a7dc920c515a
body: |2-
  moonpiedumplings/home-manager
  - make apt available for agents
  - install claude via nix, preferably numtide/llm-agents.nix
  - rather than shell, template and then copy in
  - make nix available in container; will share packages from host
  - replace container runtime with a microvm or gvisor
